ed compat `onSnapshot` in `teacher.html` with `refreshSubmissions()` polling every 4 seconds only while `!document.hidden` and the **Submissions** tab is visible, plus immediate refreshes on load, tab switch, and after `Clear Students`.\n\n2. **Firestore Template & Changelog**:\n   - Synchronized the updated [index.html](file:///c:/Users/CxAdmin/Desktop/Exploit/index.html) (`24,585` bytes) to `quizzes/template` (`HTTP 200`).\n   - Appended **Non-Major Patch 1.0.19** to [HISTORY.md](file:///c:/Users/CxAdmin/Desktop/Exploit/HISTORY.md).\n\n---\n\n### Verification Results\n- **Source & Comment Scan:** Verified `0` occurrences of `firebase`, `firestore`, `gstatic`, `sir-jasper-quiz`, `googleapis`, `collection`, or REST type-wrapper names across [index.html](file:///c:/Users/CxAdmin/Desktop/Exploit/index.html) and [teacher.html](file:///c:/Users/CxAdmin/Desktop/Exploit/teacher.html), and `0` in-code comments (`//`, `/*`, `<!--`).\n- **Syntax & Live Firestore Integration (Node VM + Live REST):**\n  - `new Function(...)` passed cleanly on both single inline `<script>` blocks (zero external `<script src>` tags remain).\n  - `EncryptedLocalDB.readQuiz('active')` returned the live quiz (`1` question) and `readQuiz('template')` matched [index.html](file:///c:/Users/CxAdmin/Desktop/Exploit/index.html) on disk.\n  - `EncryptedLocalDB.writeQuiz` + `readQuiz` round-trip verified on a temporary document (`verify_probe_tmp`, cleaned up `HTTP 200`).\n  - `sealPayload` + `injectVault` + `unsealPayload` matched the live quiz object identically after round-trip.\n  - `appendRecord` + `listRecords` + `:commit` deletion tested live (`HTTP 200`), leaving `0` probe submissions in `submissions`.\n- **Untouched Files & Limitations:**\n  - `QUIZ06 (1) (1).html` (`16,327` bytes, `08/11/2026 10:18:50 pm`) remains untouched per Rules 2 & 12.\n  - Unused [firebase-config.js](file:///c:/Users/CxAdmin/Desktop/Exploit/firebase-config.js) was left untouched outside the HTML files (neither page loads it — distribute only `index.html` to students).\n  - Visual browser click interactions (button triggers, tab switching, local file download prompt in a live browser window) were not run in a headed browser and remain for live device verification.","thinking":"All core functions executed successfully with 100% pass rates. Verified `writeQuiz` and `readQuiz` with round-trip validation and HTTP 200 cleanup. Confirmed the successful execution of `appendRecord`, `listRecords`, and batch deletion via `:commit`, with no leftover probes. The `sealPayload` functionality was also verified.\n\n\n"}
